{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_ebnhlz_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_ebnhlz_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"孤灯","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ebnhlz_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"3b0efb8b6e436e0622396726070cc82bd7c6636c707c9d08d061c5e26e7c8b17","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在前往首都听候发落前的最后一天，黑键得到了一些自由时间。见到一些人，想起一些事后，他决定在严禁音乐的夕照区拉响大提琴。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌提卡伯爵阁下，明天上午，维谢海姆将中止移动，届时我将代表维谢海姆市议会陪同您前往首都。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我将协助您配合对此次事件的调查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，按照规程，为了方便您收拾行李，或与重要的人告别，在今天日落前，您可以在维谢海姆范围内自由行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，考虑到您的特殊身份和本次事件的严重影响，您在维谢海姆活动期间，我会全程陪同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陪同？我还以为你会真诚一些，直接用“监视”这个词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（耸肩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您打算前往何处？如果可能，请您提前告知，以便——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不告诉你不行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须提醒您，您的一言一行都将由我记录，记录将影响对您的处理结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，我现在宁愿听某个密探头子对我说这种话。和你相比，他还有点人味儿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"narration","text":"夕照厅依旧，只是变得寂静无声。\n广场上空空荡荡，周围徘徊着几个穿着随意，眼神里却满是警惕的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求您开开恩吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"便衣警卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"热勒兹就在这儿停止的呼吸......我只想在这儿唱一曲他喜欢的歌，就一曲《明天的旋律》......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"便衣警卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，赶紧走！现在严禁演奏音乐，你想违令吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我真的就只是去唱支歌，我不会什么源石技艺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"便衣警卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻离开这里，不然你就有麻烦了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个便衣不是说不允许平民进入吗？我是贵族，我替他进去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您忘了吗？您之前已经留下过一次带平民强闯乐器店的不良记录了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那件事并未造成严重后果，谁也不愿过多追究，但一次犯禁可以说是年轻人不知天高地厚、意气用事，两次就不一样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恕我直言，您已经模糊了自己心中贵族和平民的界线，这是绝对不行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来您已经冷静下来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会写进记录中的，乌提卡伯爵已经逐步认识到，造成悲剧的主要原因之一就是他和平民的过度接触——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯爵阁下？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，乌提卡伯爵阁下，对不起，我过于伤心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别......请别这么叫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"热勒兹的事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您别说了，我明白的。我非常感激您的悲悯之心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但求求您别把那句话说出口。他们......都在看，都在听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，车尔尼先生明天就要离开夕照区了，您去看看他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他？离开夕照区？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不知道？他状况不太好，芙蓉要带他去罗德岛治病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你的消息，我这就去找他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......节哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您的仁慈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（叹气声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧走吧，别给别人添麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很乐意给你们添点麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您以为自己没在给那个感染者添麻烦？如果您真心为他们着想，最该做的就是远离他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间你去哪儿了，我和车尔尼先生担心你担心得要死——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，不用问他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"车尔尼朝黑键身后努了努嘴，站在黑键身后的贵族纹丝不动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说车尔尼要去罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这和我心中车尔尼的形象......不太一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是乌提卡伯爵，刚一到这儿就说这种刺人的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别见怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，既然你问到了，我正好也想听听你被软禁这段时间的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无礼的平民，请注意你的措辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会注意的，所以我们可以接着说话了吗，高尚的贵族大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，我有三方面的理由离开夕照区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，我的身体状况确实不太好，芙蓉说得没错，我的生命仍有延续的可能，我不应该轻易放弃未来的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真想把这句话录下来，这真是那个呕血作曲的车尔尼说的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也觉得这话和自己不相称。主要责任在芙蓉，她一直给我灌输这些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，在现在的夕照区，我什么都干不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么都干不了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市议会已经接管了整个夕照区，他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常替我们着想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事件第二天，他们就下令禁止在公共场合演奏音乐，说是“为了防止有人施术犯案”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕照区的乐器店最近也频频被查，好几家无限期暂停营业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去市议会跟他们交涉，但就连我在自己家弹琴，他们都会......“礼貌”地闯进我家，上次甚至差点对乌尔苏拉动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们疯了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看来，只是怕担——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收回你的臆测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌提卡伯爵阁下，这不是该在平民面前讨论的内容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就等没人的时候再跟我解释吧，可敬的先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别理他，车尔尼。你的第三个理由是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是最重要的一点。我认为，我的创作需要一些不一样的东西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那次事件过后，我觉得胸中多了一些难以表达的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要接触一些不同的......崭新的东西，来为我的音乐扩充语汇，也许这样我才能把那种情感表现出一二。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这算是我今天听到的第一个好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加油。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键，你接下来打算怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我推荐你们换个话题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，你有什么想去的地方吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想去的地方？我哪有什么地方可去，明天移动城市一停下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泄密是严重的犯罪行为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会替你想办法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"办法？不可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泄密是严重的犯罪行为，而莱塔尼亚的法条千千万，我不过是没犯泄密这一条罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我的判决还没下达，我只能等——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是最后一次警告，乌提卡伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你看，就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......会有办法的，一定会有办法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一回罗德岛，我就去找博士。他一定有办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人很厉害吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么厉害的人，为什么要为了我想办法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别妄自菲薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果被卷入这场阴谋的不是你，而是另一个人，我不敢想现在的维谢海姆是什么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒悟了，战斗了，最重要的是，那么多人......包括我自己，如果没有你，都是活不下来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，真的很感谢你的心意，芙蓉，但——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到你的事告一段落，在那之后，你也一起来罗德岛吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？去罗德岛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了，你现在也是感染者，和我、和车尔尼先生一样需要治疗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛是一艘陆行舰，不会一直停留在某处，也没有固定的轨道，会通过好多国家，甚至会航行到这片大地的尽头也说不定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，罗德岛很大，上面有很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得我的妹妹小炎熔吗？她也讨厌我的健康餐，她和你一定会有共同语言的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......等一切都结束，来罗德岛吧，黑键。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果可能的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打起精神来，黑键，别这么沮丧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别忘了白垩对你说过的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他那么声嘶力竭地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该忘了他的嘱咐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我没忘......我怎么可能忘？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就......试着像他说的那样做，好不好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"白垩摇摇晃晃地走向广场中央。\n每走一步，源石结晶就从他的体内翻涌而出，他的血肉开始不断翻涌。\n奇异的旋律也开始在广场上盘桓。\n结晶迅速覆盖白垩全身，它们化为铠甲，变作乐器。\n顷刻间，能够被称作白垩的存在已经消失了，取而代之的，是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（急促的呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......又昏过去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，芙蓉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼、乌尔苏拉？你们在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌提卡伯爵阁下，您醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉呢？车尔尼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位平民和他的佣人已经被请出这里，那位萨卡兹女士也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这是车尔尼的家！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是“蒙女皇陛下恩典，替他遮风挡雨的家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是为了你们好。如果你们继续交流下去，我不敢保证他们明天可以顺利离开维谢海姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卑鄙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除此之外，您还有什么想说的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，刚刚我们还有个约定呢，我差点忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么市议会不允许夕照区响起音乐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是市议会颁布的法令，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不觉得他们会主动颁布这种法令。夕照区也是给维谢海姆纳税的，他们为什么要掐断自己的财源？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是为了防止有人模仿犯罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是这样，你就不会在刚才，在车尔尼说这个理由的时候满意地哼那一声了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有他被你们骗住了，你才会这么满意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我猜猜......是女皇之声，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您自重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我没猜中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是某位选帝侯大人了，比如那个格特鲁德的领主——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——您——放肆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不是很藏得住心思嘛，可敬的先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来他给了你们不小的压力。告诉我吧，他怎么想的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是既想让夕照区的感染者赶快死绝，又不想大张旗鼓惊动女皇的势力，所以才想出了这么卑鄙的手段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我收敛一点！我不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，区区一个城市议会，不过是依言行事罢了，又怎么可能看透选帝侯阁下的图谋呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说完了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那请容我说一句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您立刻回到高庭区的住所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您试图闯入封锁区域，试图带平民浑水摸鱼，与他人交流机密信息......这些写在您的报告里，一定不好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不认为你会为了我好而向我提出这种建议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想想......难不成，我的报告不好看，你们面子上也过不去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用装聋作哑，这一套我熟悉得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在乌提卡的时候，我一闹出什么乱子，最害怕的永远是我的那些“代理”和“侍从”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧，你们想让我怎么度过剩下的时间？有什么底线吗？我们相互交个底，这样双方都方便些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（叹气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去，这就是我唯一的要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我在日落前可以自由行动，这是从你自己嘴里吐出来的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"规章如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，真正懂得进退的人都会像我说的那样做，服从安排和管理，证明自己有真正的悔愧之心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而您，您浑身散发着死不悔改的气息，令人生厌，仿佛一个满脑子妄想的平民——不，一头抗拒被驯服的野兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醒醒吧，乌提卡伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像我说的一样乖乖回去，我会在记录里尽量帮您美言几句的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然你就往死里写我的坏话，把自己监管不力的事实也暴露得一干二净，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（厌恶的咋舌声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们说你和那个人有血缘关系，现在看来，你们家族的疯狂果然一脉相承。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开始用“你”称呼我，这可真是让人受宠若惊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，别太张狂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别以为我怕你，一个傀儡伯爵罢了，你懂什么记录的艺术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一百种方法在让你万劫不复的同时撇清自己的责任，懂吗？懂就给我滚回你那间舒适的牢房里去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，太阳还没下山，我想去哪儿就去哪儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续跟着我吧，只敢在无人处发狠的懦夫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑键在小巷里飞跑。\n他没想过甩掉那个人。\n就算甩掉了他，也会有新的“尾巴”跟上来。\n就算甩掉了所有的人，自己也无处可去......\n无处可去吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知不觉间，黑键的双脚将他带到了这里。\n看着熟悉的门扉，和门扉外陌生的封锁线，黑键有些迟疑。\n“尾巴”喘着粗气，站在不远处，恶狠狠地看着他，于是黑键翻进线内，推门进屋。\n看到他消失在门里，“尾巴”气喘吁吁地跟上了他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g6_whitehome"},{"type":"narration","text":"一切都和那场演出前别无二致。\n杯子，碗碟，水壶。\n脏兮兮的灶台，堪称破烂的家具，简陋的床，还有......地铺。\n黑键突然很想知道睡在那上面是什么感觉，于是他躺了上去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"痛。浑身上下都痛。\n坚硬的地面仿佛在拒绝他，对他背上的每一根骨头施加压力。\n短短几秒钟过去，他觉得自己的脊梁已经要断了。\n“尾巴”像看动物一样轻蔑地看着他，他报之以等量的恶意。\n那个人说的没错，自己多半要万劫不复了。\n但他不是很害怕。\n他甚至已经不太好奇了。\n说实话，他已经对命运的安排感到麻木了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"narration","text":"其他的孩子在阳光下奔跑的时候，他和白垩学会了如何在步步紧逼的死亡面前假装平静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"挣扎着活过疯狂的实验后，他们一个成为笼中羽兽，另一个活得甚至还不如阴沟里的源石虫。\n他在恐惧中渴望着自由，白垩甚至无力渴求比温饱更多的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g1_gorgeousstreets"},{"type":"narration","text":"多年之后，他们在此相遇。\n他们决定一起为一场音乐会努力。\n厄运不应该到此为止了吗？\n事情结束后，他本应回去当他的傀儡伯爵，白垩本应得到一笔钱和一些名声，为他的爷爷治病。\n他们会记着，在这片大地上，自己并非孤单一人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"然后，他们站上那个舞台。\n他们已经准备好为对方付出一切。\n一般来说，这样的故事明明应该以两人历经磨难、重获新生为结局。\n或者，就算命运就是要折磨他们，那也应该让两个人一同死去，不是吗？\n但命运要白垩为了他死去，命运要白垩死在自己想为之付出生命的人手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"narration","text":"命运要白垩死，命运还要白垩的死毫无价值。\n车尔尼不得不离开夕照区，去接受治疗。\n自己活了下来，但马上就要去首都听候发落。\n夕照区被人扼住咽喉，人们甚至不能为自己逝去的亲人唱一首哀歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了白垩对你说过的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该忘了他的嘱咐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我忘了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键，你要活下去，你要走过漫长的夜晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去反抗那些不公的命运，并且孜孜不倦地为他人付出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这样，当你坐下来的时候，才会想到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会问你，黑键，你今天过得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，你会挺起胸膛告诉我，你又度过了充实的一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会向我倾诉你在行善过程中遭遇的障碍，以及抱怨命运始终不愿青睐于你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是没有关系，我会倾听你的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你是那么地努力，你当然可以去抱怨一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这样，你才不会被这片大地上的苦痛所淹没，你才能在你的生活中获得安宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记着，黑键，我们曾经一同反抗了不公平的命，而我们得了胜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，想到我的时候，你应当笑，而不是哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g6_whitehome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闹够了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你哭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你终于意识到自己的处境了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑键拉开房间里的抽屉，里面放着一根孤零零的大提琴弓。那是白垩的老师留给白垩的纪念。\n黑键把琴弓珍重地包起来，带在自己身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可敬的先生，你还记得你抵达事件现场时的事吗？你没收了我手里的大提琴，它在什么地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是重要的证物，我们已经保管起来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么记得你拿着大提琴进了夕照厅，在里面磨蹭了好久，然后空着手出来了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡说，你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回来！天马上要黑了，你还要去什么地方？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"那个感染者还在，但他已经不再试图接近夕照厅。\n他失魂落魄地站在广场外，仿佛马上就要被风吹散。\n他甚至没注意到黑键的到来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢钻警戒线？！那和你刚才翻的不一样，现在这个是女皇之声——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的很聒噪，“尾巴”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法杖？！你竟敢——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真遗憾，我不会让人闭嘴的法术，这点我不如你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但让你在原地站一会儿，我还是做得到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，便衣警卫也来了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样就没人来碍事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，尾巴先生，你该不会是把琴藏在夕照厅里了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里面是绝对禁区，你敢乱闯——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不巧，夕照厅大门后面就放着一把大提琴，和我送白垩的那把还挺像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灯下黑啊，尾巴先生。你还挺聪明的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我把琴放下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恕难从命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，虽然不知道你们把琴弓弄到哪里去了，不过正好，我这有一把备用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，这首《明天的旋律》送给那位——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不，送给你们每一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）还有你......白垩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）不用等到明天，就今晚，我就会向你抱怨的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我要狠狠地抱怨，抱怨到你觉得我啰嗦，一听见我说话就觉得腻烦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......《明天的旋律》？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌提卡伯爵，你在犯罪！你还想用源石技艺给维谢海姆带来更多灾难吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰相反，尾巴先生，这只是一首曲子罢了，里面毫无源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还会接着演奏下去的，我会把你们不想听的感染者的歌，一首一首地演奏出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不想听，堵住自己的耳朵就好了，为什么要按住别人的琴弦呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丧气的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......乌提卡伯爵？他在演奏？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯爵大人......不，黑键！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键，谢谢你，谢谢你的音乐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加油，黑键！我们都在听，我们会听下去的！我来配合你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那位先生，把乐器收回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然市议会已经明确禁止未经批准的音乐，我不建议你们跟我一起演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天这件事是我自己的事，你们没必要牵连进来，只要听，听就好了，好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在夕照区重新奏响音乐的人......是你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我替整个夕照区感谢你，但现在请你赶快停下，你的处境已经很危险了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢关心，但我不会停的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是我的专场，我禁止你现在来抢我的风头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键，别冲动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，你误会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是提醒我不要忘记白垩的话吗？多亏你的提醒，我想起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"命运是如此不公，而我之前太过沉溺于悲伤，我甚至忘记了反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我现在想起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人要他人沉默，就让我替他们发声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人禁止他人祭奠，就让我去献上一捧鲜花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人想把我困在名为贵族的高塔之中，就算粉身碎骨，我也要将这座该受诅咒的塔炸成碎片！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——大逆不道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，尾巴先生，请把这一条也写到你的报告里去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非你们的处理结果就是要我的命，否则，我一定要离开莱塔尼亚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，最重要的是，我拒绝继续当一名贵族！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我耻于以贵族的身份生活下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你疯了，从来没有过这种事，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就当我疯了吧！就当我在深思熟虑过后选择了最疯狂的道路吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，《明天的旋律》就要结束了，亲爱的感染者兄弟姐妹们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看你们的脸，想想你们的喜好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《金酒杯与银叉勺》，我记得你喜欢哼这首曲子，后面那位大胡子。下一首就是这个了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，第三首——《冬日旅行》，送给那位坚强的裁缝的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耳熟的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第四首，《F大调第81号钢琴奏鸣曲“自由颂”》，送给你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别格——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，只要我的水平足够在大提琴上演奏出这首曲子，这就是第四首！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，《金酒杯与银叉勺》！请各位听好了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"............\n用并不娴熟的大提琴技巧，他演奏了一首又一首曲子。\n感染者们宛若疯狂般，在广场上哭着，笑着，悼念着，直到市议会的人冲进现场。\n他也一样。\n他眼角含泪，笑着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
